    {"id":"note1","type":"text","x":40,"y":556,"width":290,"height":180,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#a0a0a0","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"roundness":null,"seed":64,"version":1,"isDeleted":false,"text":"不变量\n\n· journal 是真源，谁也不改写它\n· normalizer 绝不丢事件\n· turn.completed 只表示 turn 边界\n  （usage 更新是另一个事件，否则每次\n   token 更新都会打一个快照）\n· agent 内置工具必须禁 ——\n  它们跑在宿主机上\n· 只在静止点打快照\n· adapter 依赖的都是无承诺接口\n  → contracts/ 每日断言","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"不变量\n\n· journal 是真源，谁也不改写它\n· normalizer 绝不丢事件\n· turn.completed 只表示 turn 边界\n  （usage 更新是另一个事件，否则每次\n   token 更新都会打一个快照）\n· agent 内置工具必须禁 ——\n  它们跑在宿主机上\n· 只在静止点打快照\n· adapter 依赖的都是无承诺接口\n  → contracts/ 每日断言","lineHeight":1.25,"boundElements":[],"link":null,"locked":false,"autoResize":true},

